            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkomeza kwitegereza, bakiriko barashirah’ intebe z’ubgami; maze haza Uwa mbere na mbere, aravyagira. Imyambaro yiwe yera nka shelegi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7:9",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "shelegi n’ikintu coroshe cera, gikoroka hasi nk’imvura, gikanye cane.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kand’ umushatsi wiwe wasa n’ubgoya bg’intama yera derere; intebe y’ubgami bgiwe yari nk’ibirimi vy’umuriro, kand’ amakurudumu yayo yari nk’umuriro waka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
