            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naritegereje ico gihe kubg’ ijwi rya ya magambo yo kwihayagiza ka gahembe kāvuga; nkiriko nditegereza, ca gikōko kiricwa, umuvyimba waco uraherengetera, utābga mu muriro urayigira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi na vya bikōko bindi, inganji yavyo birayakwa: ariko vyongerwa ukubaho gushitsa igihe kinaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
